Muscle diagrams from the wger project (https://github.com/wger-project/wger),
wger/core/static/images/muscles/ at tag 2.7, unmodified.

  muscular_system_front.svg, muscular_system_back.svg   base bodies
  main/muscle-{id}.svg                                   primary-muscle overlays (red)
  secondary/muscle-{id}.svg                              secondary-muscle overlays (orange)

{id} is the wger muscle id (see src/domain/wger.ts).

The drawings derive from the Wikimedia Commons "Muscular system" artwork and
are used here under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Only the artwork is used;
no wger code (AGPL) is copied.

public/images/muscles/ holds optimised (modified: SVGO, viewBox added) copies,
generated by `npm run muscles:build`. Credited on the app's /credits screen.
